runv7 — INSTALL
===============

runv7 is a set of scripts; there is nothing to compile.

Requirements:
  * simh (`pdp11` on the PATH)
  * curl
  * python3 (3.6+)

Build and install:

    ./configure            # optional; sets the PREFIX
    make                   # nothing to build
    make check             # ./fetch lists the available images
    make install           # installs fetch/boot.py + ini/ under PREFIX

Or just run in place:

    ./fetch v7-pcollinson
    ./boot.py --ini ini/v7-pcollinson.ini
